Map:Valley_of_the_End
"Valley of the End (2-4 Players)"
End

Map:Valley_of_the_End_Desc
"The legendary gorge separating the Land of Fire and Land of Sound. Giant stone statues of Hashirama Senju and Madara Uchiha flank the thunderous waterfall. Control the high plateaus and secure the ancient chakra springs to overpower your rivals."
End
